{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '260,370p' src/cljc/yin/vm/ucf/remote.cljc | nl -ba -v 260\"","aggregated_output":"   260\t\n   261\t\n   262\t(defn lower-pending\n   263\t  \"One pending entry of S7.4.3, lowered from `pending` (a\n   264\t   `:yin.k/pending` value) and its `cells` table (the matching\n   265\t   `:yin.k/cells`) back into the local shape `lift-pending` accepts,\n   266\t   its markers replaced by reflections `attach!` gives on the original\n   267\t   logical streams: attaching to every descriptor the entry names and\n   268\t   re-minting an equivalent wait on the local handles (S7.4.3). The\n   269\t   S7.9 `:yin.k/unsatisfied` outcome, naming the stream identity where\n   270\t   one is known, when `attach!` refuses a stream the entry needs -- a\n   271\t   reflection marked gone included. An unrecognized `:yin.k/reason` is\n   272\t   `:yin.k/undecodable`, naming the reason.\"\n   273\t  [attach! pending cells]\n   274\t  (case (:yin.k/reason pending)\n   275\t    :next\n   276\t    (if-let [r (lower-response attach! cells (:yin.k/cell pending))]\n   277\t      {:reason :next, :stream {:handle (:handle r)}, :position (:position r)}\n   278\t      (unsatisfied (cell-identity cells (:yin.k/cell pending))))\n   279\t\n   280\t    :put\n   281\t    (if-let [h (lower-marker attach! (:yin.k/stream pending))]\n   282\t      {:reason :put, :stream {:handle h}, :value (:yin.k/value pending)}\n   283\t      (unsatisfied (get-in pending [:yin.k/stream :dao.stream/identity])))\n   284\t\n   285\t    :ffi\n   286\t    (let [req (lower-marker attach! (:yin.k/request pending))\n   287\t          resp (when req (lower-response attach! cells (:yin.k/cell pending)))]\n   288\t      (cond\n   289\t        (and req resp)\n   290\t        {:reason :ffi, :call-id (:yin.k/call-id pending),\n   291\t         :op (:yin.k/op pending),\n   292\t         :request {:handle req}, :response {:handle (:handle resp)},\n   293\t         :position (:position resp)}\n   294\t\n   295\t        (nil? req)\n   296\t        (unsatisfied (get-in pending [:yin.k/request :dao.stream/identity]))\n   297\t\n   298\t        :else (unsatisfied (cell-identity cells (:yin.k/cell pending)))))\n   299\t\n   300\t    :ffi-request\n   301\t    (let [req (lower-marker attach! (:yin.k/request pending))\n   302\t          resp (when req (lower-response attach! cells (:yin.k/cell pending)))]\n   303\t      (cond\n   304\t        (and req resp)\n   305\t        {:reason :ffi-request, :call-id (:yin.k/call-id pending),\n   306\t         :request-op (:yin.k/request-op pending),\n   307\t         :request-args (:yin.k/request-args pending),\n   308\t         :request {:handle req}, :response {:handle (:handle resp)},\n   309\t         :position (:position resp)}\n   310\t\n   311\t        (nil? req)\n   312\t        (unsatisfied (get-in pending [:yin.k/request :dao.stream/identity]))\n   313\t\n   314\t        :else (unsatisfied (cell-identity cells (:yin.k/cell pending)))))\n   315\t\n   316\t    :link-request\n   317\t    (let [req (lower-marker attach! (:yin.k/request pending))\n   318\t          resp (when req (lower-response attach! cells (:yin.k/cell pending)))]\n   319\t      (cond\n   320\t        (and req resp)\n   321\t        {:reason :link-request, :link-id (:yin.k/link-id pending),\n   322\t         :envelope (:yin.k/envelope pending),\n   323\t         :request {:handle req}, :response {:handle (:handle resp)},\n   324\t         :position (:position resp)}\n   325\t\n   326\t        (nil? req)\n   327\t        (unsatisfied (get-in pending [:yin.k/request :dao.stream/identity]))\n   328\t\n   329\t        :else (unsatisfied (cell-identity cells (:yin.k/cell pending)))))\n   330\t\n   331\t    :link-response\n   332\t    (if-let [resp (lower-response attach! cells (:yin.k/cell pending))]\n   333\t      {:reason :link-response, :link-id (:yin.k/link-id pending),\n   334\t       :response {:handle (:handle resp)}, :position (:position resp)}\n   335\t      (unsatisfied (cell-identity cells (:yin.k/cell pending))))\n   336\t\n   337\t    :install\n   338\t    {:reason :install, :name (:yin.k/name pending)}\n   339\t\n   340\t    {:yin.k/status :yin.k/undecodable, :yin.k/reason (:yin.k/reason pending)}))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
